MBEDTLS_ECDH_GEN_PUBLIC_ALT|MBEDTLS_ECDH_GEN_PUBLIC_ALT|Functions||||Use your alternate core implementation of symmetric crypto or hash function. Keep in mind that function prototypes should remain the same. This replaces only one function. The header file from mbed TLS is still used, in contrast to the MBEDTLS__MODULE_NAME__ALT flags. Note: if you use the AES_xxx_ALT macros, then is is recommended to also set MBEDTLS_AES_ROM_TABLES in order to help the linker garbage-collect the AES tables. <b>Default value: </b>Not Defined(//#define)
